# ElectroBench scene 3 teapot material.
# One material for the whole model; map_Kd points at the placeholder texture
# (assets/teapot_placeholder.png) — swap that PNG for your own decal/glaze and
# keep the file name, or edit this line to match a new texture name.
newmtl teapot_glaze
